# _headers (Cloudflare Pages)
# ===============================================

# Note: Cloudflare Pages _headers does NOT support domain‑specific rules.
# These rules apply to ALL domains served by this Pages project.
# For domain‑specific headers, use a Worker or Cloudflare Transform Rules.

# 1. Set X-Frame-Options for all paths
/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN

# 2. Single Page Application fallback – all unmatched routes serve index.html
/* /index.html 200